  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 5th level, the punk does not provoke attacks of opportunities when performing combat maneuvers if he succeeds on a DC 15 Will save. He must make this Will save every time he would provoke an attack of opportunity. At 9th level, this also applies to attacks of opportunity provoked from the punk’s movement but with a DC 20. Additionally, at 9th level, the punk automatically passes his no fear checks for attacks of opportunities provoked by combat maneuvers.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/the-punk#toc28\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
